  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You may shunt attempts to control or possess you into the hellcore at your center.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Hellcore species feature.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Once a day you may reroll a Will save versus a possession or mind-affecting effect. If successful this effect targets your hellcore instead of you harmlessly lost in targeting the fragmented essence.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/xodai#toc34\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
